    "version_first_page_text": "                               Product        Sample &         Technical            Tools &          Support &\n                                Folder         Buy            Documents         Software        Community\n\n\n                                                                          TMP461\n\n                                                                            SBOS722B –JUNE 2015–REVISED AUGUST 2016\n        TMP461 High-Accuracy Remote and Local Temperature Sensor with\n                         Pin-Programmable Bus Address\n\n1  Features                              3  Description\n1•  Remote Diode Temperature Sensor Accuracy:        The TMP461 device is a high-accuracy, low-power\n                                                   remote temperature sensor monitor with a  built-in   ±0.75°C\n                                                                local temperature sensor. The remote temperature\n•  Local Temperature Sensor Accuracy: ±1°C                                                     sensors are typically low-cost discrete NPN or PNP\n•  Resolution for Local and Remote Channels:             transistors, or substrate thermal transistors or diodes\n   0.0625°C                                                  that   are   integral   parts   of   microprocessors,\n                                                             microcontrollers, or field-programmable gate arrays•  Supply and Logic Voltage Range: 1.7 V to 3.6 V\n                                                   (FPGAs). Temperature  is represented as a  12-bit\n•  35-µA Operating Current (1 SPS),                                                                       digital code for both local and remote sensors, giving\n   3-µA Shutdown Current                                               a resolution of 0.0625°C. The two-wire serial interface\n•  Series Resistance Cancellation                      accepts the SMBus communication protocol with up\n                                                               to nine different pin-programmable addresses.•  η-Factor and Offset Correction\n•  Programmable Digital Filter                       Advanced  features  [such  as  series  resistance\n                                                              cancellation,  programmable  nonideality  factor  (η-•  Diode Fault Detection\n                                                                    factor),   programmable     offset,   programmable\n•  Two-Wire and SMBus™Serial Interface                                                      temperature limits, and a programmable digital filter]\n   Compatible with Pin-Programmable Address                                                       are combined to provide a robust thermal monitoring\n•  10-Lead WQFN Package                                solution with improved accuracy and noise immunity.\n\n                                              The TMP461 is ideal for multi-location, high-accuracy\n2  Applications                                                      temperature  measurements    in  a   variety   of\n•  Processor Temperature Monitoring                   communication,  computing,  instrumentation,  and\n                                                                  industrial  applications. The device  is  specified  for•  Telecommunication Equipment\n                                                         operation over a supply voltage range of 1.7 V to\n•  Servers and Personal Computers                                                         3.6 V, and a temperature range of –40°C to 125°C.\n•   Precision Instruments\n                                                               Device Information(1)•  Test Equipment\n•  Smart Batteries                                   PART NUMBER     PACKAGE    BODY SIZE (NOM)\n                                                     TMP461        WQFN (10)          2.00 mm × 2.00 mm\n•  Embedded Applications\n•  LED Lighting Thermal Control                                     (1) For all available packages, see the orderable addendum at\n                                                                            the end of the datasheet.\n\n4  Simplified Block Diagram\n\n                                                                   1.7 V to 3.6 V                                                  1.7 V to 3.6 V\n\n\n\n\n                                                                      10\n                                                                 A1                            Processor or ASIC\n                                                          1                           9\n                                                       V+              SCL\n\n                                                          2                           8\n                                                    D+    TMP461   SDA                                     SMBus\n                                                                                                                                                                Controller\n                                     Built-In Thermal                    3   D-     ALERT/THERM2  7\n                                Transistor, Diode\n                                                          4                           6\n                                                THERM        GND\n\n                                                                 A0\n                                                                          5\n\n\n                                                                                                                                  Overtemperature Shutdown\n\n\n\n\n\n1\n\n\n\n     An IMPORTANT NOTICE at the end of this data sheet addresses availability, warranty, changes, use in safety-critical applications,\n        intellectual property matters and other important disclaimers. PRODUCTION DATA."
